Bundled assets:

* TeX Gyre Heros OTF files in src/pretty_plots/idl/fonts/ are distributed under the
  GUST Font License (a free, permissive license; see fonts/PROVENANCE.txt).
  Original source: https://www.gust.org.pl/projects/e-foundry/tex-gyre/heros

* Hershey font JHF files in src/pretty_plots/idl/hershey/data/ are based on the
  public-domain Hershey vector fonts originally published by Allen V. Hershey
  in 1967. The JHF format encoding is by James Hurt and is also in the public
  domain.
